  The storage dispatch adds no thermal violations beyond those
  already present with storage idle. The transformer exceeds its
  rating in the import direction at high demand even with no solar
  and no storage, because a German feeder's load is modulated by an
  Irish system-load shape; the hosting criterion is therefore
  applied to the export direction only.

